Summarize upcoming contract renewals.

Total upcoming (next 120 days): {{ $json.totalUpcoming }}
Urgent (notice deadline within 14 days): {{ $json.urgent.length }}
Auto-renew risk (notice deadline passed): {{ $json.noticePassed.length }}
Due within 30 days: {{ $json.upcoming30.length }}

Urgent contracts:
{{ $json.urgent.map(c => c.contract_name + ' (' + c.vendor_name + '): renews ' + c.renewal_date + ', notice deadline in ' + c.daysUntilNotice + ' days, ' + c.currency + c.annual_value + '/yr, satisfaction: ' + (c.satisfaction_level||'not rated') + (c.usage_notes?' - '+c.usage_notes:'')).join('\n') || 'none' }}

Auto-renew risk contracts:
{{ $json.noticePassed.map(c => c.contract_name + ' (' + c.vendor_name + '): notice deadline already passed, will auto-renew at ' + c.currency + c.annual_value).join('\n') || 'none' }}

Return JSON: {"digest_summary":"2-3 sentences on the overall renewal picture this period","contract_recommendations":[{"contract_name":"","recommendation":"renew|renegotiate|cancel|investigate","rationale":"brief reason based on satisfaction/usage notes"}],"action_needed_this_week":["specific actions with deadlines"]}
